00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:45.033
And I'm so used to not sleeping with him.

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:50.633
I forgot he was in the bed.

00:12:53.508 --> 00:12:57.730
I forgot.

00:12:57.730 --> 00:12:58.563
I forgot.

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:07.023
I forgot he was there.

00:13:13.034 --> 00:13:15.034
