00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:44.733
- Yes,

00:19:48.672 --> 00:19:49.505
I know.

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:51.873
- And to be with you for your daughter.

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:55.667
- I know and it's,

00:19:55.667 --> 00:19:58.127
that's what keeps me going now, uh,

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:03.893
we have so much going
on and so many losses.

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:07.020
You forget what you have

00:20:09.065 --> 00:20:10.215
and I forgot about her,

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.197
I forgot about her.

00:20:19.319 --> 00:20:22.293
I forgot how important I was to someone.

